# Python standards

- Python 3.12, type hints everywhere, Pydantic v2 models for I/O
- Async SQLAlchemy 2 only; never reach into another module's tables
- Tenant queries must run inside a transaction that sets `app.tenant_id`
- No hard-coded secrets; settings come from pydantic-settings
- Ruff for lint/format; tests live alongside code under `tests/`
- Never weaken isolation, auth, or number-firewall tests
